    I dunno. If you're interested in a more challenging game and don't mind 
being mobbed by murderous monsters you could just kill your dog with missile 
weapons and eat it. Aggravate monsters is a fun intrinsic, tho' not 
particularly desirable in most circumstances. But, hey. The *challenge* is 
what you play the game for anyway, right?

